  "operation": {
    "summary": "Client Has Membership",
    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "Read operation. Retrieve all required pages before reporting complete totals. Resolves a client by `barcode` and reports whether they have an active membership. The barcode is supplied in the `q` query parameter; there is no request body. When the barcode resolves to a client with an active membership the response includes the `membership` record; otherwise it returns a `message` indicating no membership or that the client was not found.",
